// title attribute on each control (see ui.js's _control()). Written from
// src/presets.js's own inline comments where one exists - that file is the
// single source of truth for what each parameter actually does, and these
// are a plain-English translation of it for someone hovering a slider, not a
// restatement of the code comment. A key with no entry here just gets no
// tooltip - better than a fabricated one.
